+#### Finish bag
+
+A text "Finish bag" under the roast line on an open bag's coffee page. It takes a second tap ("Tap again to finish
+this bag"), then writes the bag again with `finished_on` set to the phone's date: a new record, never a delete, and
+finishing twice writes once. The page reloads showing "Finished Oct 31" and the notice "Bag finished: Onyx
+Geometry". The bag leaves Today, Switch coffee and Log shot. It stays in Coffees, marked finished, with its shots,
+and correcting one of its shots still offers it. Edit bag's "Still using it" opens it again.
+
